# cx-audit: E10 "How about this?" from the word list, every way out of it, and the keys while the service is down.
#seed family.json
wait S1
press a
wait M1
press a
wait M3
press coin
wait M4
say a game about a penguin who says shit a lot
hold a 300
wait M6
press a
wait E10
shot E10-how-about-this
# Say it a new way: back at the mic.
press down
press a
wait say idle
shot E10-say-it-a-new-way
press esc
wait M3
shot E10-esc-from-mic-is-coin-check
press coin
wait M4
say a game about a penguin who says shit a lot
hold a 300
wait M6
press a
wait E10
press esc
wait S1
shot E10-esc-is-shelf
# The service goes away for 8 s: every key, then it comes back.
restart 8000
shot E4-during
press a
press esc
press coin
press start
shot E4-after-keys
wait S1
shot S1-back
